WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.975
Who does what?

2
00:00:00.975 --> 00:00:03.641
Operators read the telemetry tab first,

3
00:00:03.641 --> 00:00:07.600
then their own family's tabs,
and each finding becomes a task.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.300
Security operations treats each dark
source as a high-severity task.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.462
And the security officer keeps the reachability
and probe records, never the render.

6
00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:20.012
Lab 1 needs only saved results.

7
00:00:20.012 --> 00:00:23.292
Lab 2 needs Log Analytics
Reader on a test workspace,

8
00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:28.250
which can view and search the monitoring
data, and the check sends only queries.

9
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.915
The live replication probe is different:
reading replication needs Enterprise

10
00:00:33.915 --> 00:00:39.050
Admins or equivalent, so Chapter 4 runs
it only on a Tier 0 host, or not at all.
